<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"></head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:24px;background:#f4f5f7;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1a1a1a;">
<div style="max-width:520px;margin:0 auto;background:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;padding:28px;">
<p>Hello{{if .name}} {{.name}}{{end}},</p>
<p>Use this code to verify your identity:</p>
<p style="font-size:28px;letter-spacing:4px;font-weight:bold;">{{.code}}</p>
<p>The code is valid for {{.expires_in_minutes}} minutes. If you did not request it, you can ignore this email.</p>
<p style="color:#666;font-size:12px;">Never share this code with anyone.</p>
</div></body></html>
